# The Night Lord's third class node: a scroll hanging in the air that fires
# stars for twelve seconds and bursts at the end.
#
# GMS's own figures: 700+27x% a star, six at each of up to seven enemies plus
# seven more regardless of the crowd, then 1570+62x% twelve times on twelve
# enemies when it ends. Bosses take 30% more from all of it.
#
# The beat is `subTime 990`, the field Shurrikane and Bolt Barrage take theirs
# from, and the only number in the block the tooltip never uses. Twelve firings
# fit in twelve seconds, and the twelfth is the burst.
#
# The seven fixed stars fire every tick, not only at the start. Namu says part
# of the stars it keeps firing scales with the crowd; `bulletCount` is GMS's
# per-cast line count everywhere else; and the balance range agrees: 276,720% at
# max is 4,612%/s over the cooldown, just under Storm of Arrows, while firing
# them only at the start gives 1,013%/s, far below the range.
#
# The 30% belongs to the scroll, stated once on the pulse and kept by the burst.
# On the buff it would be a character-wide boss bonus for twelve seconds in
# sixty, a different and much stronger skill.
#
# The cast is the 120ms every buff cast from a sequence costs, not the scroll's
# 360ms animation.
#
# Dropped: detonating it early, which needs the scroll to have a position, and
# immunity to attack reflection, which nothing here has.
name: "Dark Lord's Omen"
description: "Unleash the power of the Dark Lord's insight."
kind: SKILL_KIND_ACTIVE
placement { job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_NIGHT_LORD_V skill_order: 3 }
v_node: V_NODE_KIND_JOB
max_level: 30
base_delay_ms: 120
cooldown_seconds: 60.0
buff {
  duration_seconds: 12.0
  pulse {
    label: "Throwing Stars"
    cast_interval_seconds: 0.99
    lines: 6
    max_enemies: 7
    max_pulses: 12
    base {
      skill_pct: 7.27
      boss_pct: 0.30
    }
    per_level { skill_pct: 0.27 }
    fixed_strikes { hits: 7 }
    final_strike {
      label: "Explosion"
      lines: 12
      max_enemies: 12
      base { skill_pct: 16.32 }
      per_level { skill_pct: 0.62 }
    }
  }
}
